{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 5,
    "Tecuhtli": 22
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7525401",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540309"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540309": {
            "id": "752540309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Thanks for the advice. What happened to your eyes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540310"
            ]
          },
          "752540310": {
            "id": "752540310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Hmph, this was the work of a hairless heathen. He left me with this mark, but I know he's somewhere on the island... and I'll be damned if I don't \"thank\" him for it later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540311"
            ]
          },
          "752540311": {
            "id": "752540311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "After hearing my story, you're sure to want to take revenge on my behalf. But that's quite alright — though I should thank you for your kindness!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540312"
            ]
          },
          "752540312": {
            "id": "752540312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Dear friend, in a summer this beautiful, nobody should be feeling sad!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540313"
            ]
          },
          "752540313": {
            "id": "752540313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Please enjoy the welcome juice I've prepared for each and every guest, then enjoy your relaxing vacation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540314"
            ]
          },
          "752540314": {
            "id": "752540314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "You'll find your beverages on that shelf over there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525402",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540201": {
            "id": "752540201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "My dear friend, now that you've had my welcome juice, let me give you a word of advice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540202"
            ]
          },
          "752540202": {
            "id": "752540202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "If you're just an ordinary visitor enjoying your vacation, then steer clear of the northernmost part of Tete Isle. There's nothing over there that will help you relax."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525401",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540101": {
            "id": "752540101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Hey there, friend! Welcome to Paititi — and Tete Isle — the place of your dreams!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540102"
            ]
          },
          "752540102": {
            "id": "752540102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Ahead, you'll find two of our bars, Me & Dew and The Dewdrop. I'm Tecuhtli, and it's my job to welcome guests!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525404",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540409"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540409": {
            "id": "752540409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Goodbye.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540410"
            ]
          },
          "752540410": {
            "id": "752540410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "You haven't asked me about my eyes..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525405",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540509"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540509": {
            "id": "752540509",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Haven't we met before?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540501"
            ]
          },
          "752540501": {
            "id": "752540501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "My friend, this is fate's mark upon the extraordinary — our first meeting feels like a reunion across lifetimes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540502"
            ]
          },
          "752540502": {
            "id": "752540502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Seeing this wolfish eye patch of mine, you've surely realized I'm pretty extraordinary, yes?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525406",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752540603"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752540603": {
            "id": "752540603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Oh? You're asking about my eyes? Hehe, well, there are three things every man has to cultivate in his life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540604"
            ]
          },
          "752540604": {
            "id": "752540604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "First! A weathered body must bear at least one scar. Otherwise, there's no way to tell what trials and tribulations a man has faced, and he would appear to lack substance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540605"
            ]
          },
          "752540605": {
            "id": "752540605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Second! Scars must be covered with clothes or accessories, but only partially... Otherwise, no one would see that this man is special.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540606"
            ]
          },
          "752540606": {
            "id": "752540606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "And third...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540607"
            ]
          },
          "752540607": {
            "id": "752540607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wait a second. I never even asked about your eyes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752540608"
            ]
          },
          "752540608": {
            "id": "752540608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Tecuhtli",
            "text": "Exactly! If others don't notice how special he is, the man must MAKE them notice by bringing it up!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
